asr-000032
00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:41.919
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: chairperson

asr-000033
00:04:41.919 --> 00:04:49.360
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: Honorable Congresswoman Mikaela Suansing and, of course, Senior Vice Chairperson

asr-000034
00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:55.600
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: Honorable Albert S. Garcia for giving us the opportunity to present the PCSO's

asr-000035
00:04:55.600 --> 00:05:01.759
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: proposed budget and programs for the coming fiscal year we are honored to

asr-000036
00:05:01.759 --> 00:05:06.800
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: appear before this committee and to share not only our budget requirements

asr-000037
00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:11.680
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: but more importantly how we intend to translate these resources into

asr-000038
00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:18.400
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: meaningful and tangible benefits for the Filipino people. The PCSO remains firmly

asr-000039
00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:24.400
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: committed to fulfilling its mandate under Republic Act No. 1169, as

asr-000040
00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:30.560
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: amended to generate and provide funds for health programs medical assistance

asr-000041
00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:38.960
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: and services and charitable activities of national character. Every peso entrusted to PCSO

asr-000042
00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:45.759
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: carries with it a responsibility to serve. Our budget, therefore, is not simply a financial

asr-000043
00:05:45.759 --> 00:05:52.560
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: plan. It is an instrument for expanding access to health care, strengthening our assistance

asr-000044
00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:59.919
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: program, bringing essential services closer to communities, and ensuring that our operations

asr-000045
00:05:59.919 --> 00:06:06.639
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: remain efficient, accountable, and responsive. PCSO continues to strengthen its financial

asr-000046
00:06:06.639 --> 00:06:14.880
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: performance, governance, responsible gaming initiatives, and delivery of charitable services.

asr-000047
00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:21.840
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: We recognize, however, that the needs of our people continue to grow. This makes prudent

asr-000048
00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:29.120
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: resource allocation, operational efficiency, and sustained support for our programs even

asr-000049
00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:36.479
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: more critical. Today, we respectfully present our proposed budget, our priorities, and

asr-000050
00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:42.639
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: the outcomes we seek to achieve. We assure the Committee that we will continue to exercise

asr-000051
00:06:42.639 --> 00:06:49.840
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: the high standards of fiscal responsibility, transparency, accountability, and good governance

asr-000052
00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:55.759
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: in the use of public resources. We look forward to the guidance and support of the Committee

asr-000053
00:06:55.759 --> 00:07:03.360
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: as we work together toward a budget that will enable PCSO to reach more beneficiaries and

asr-000054
00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:06.395
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: create greater impact for the Filipino people.

asr-000056
00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:13.120
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: Once again, our deepest appreciation to the distinguished members of the Committee

asr-000057
00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:18.400
PCSO Chairperson Judge Felix P. Reyes: on Appropriations. Thank you very much, and good afternoon. And for our report, may I

