asr-000414
00:44:44.880 --> 00:44:46.640
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Chairman, good afternoon.

asr-000415
00:44:46.640 --> 00:44:58.159
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: As you know, all the cities of our country have ambulances.

asr-000416
00:44:58.159 --> 00:45:02.061
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Ang iba pong mga bayan ay marami pong isla.

asr-000417
00:45:02.061 --> 00:45:06.880
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, ang kanilang mga ambulansya ay hindi rin po makakatawid.

asr-000418
00:45:06.880 --> 00:45:12.640
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, it will be just inside the municipal island or the area nila.

asr-000419
00:45:12.640 --> 00:45:20.731
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, kasama rin po sa aming mandate for providing medical mobility,

asr-000420
00:45:20.731 --> 00:45:24.894
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: sa aming mandate namin to provide charities of national character,

asr-000421
00:45:24.894 --> 00:45:31.648
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: ang gawin pong effective yung pinamigay namin mga ambulanses or PTP na tinatawag.

asr-000422
00:45:31.648 --> 00:45:39.248
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And yun po ang nakita namin na very effective way to,

asr-000423
00:45:39.248 --> 00:45:42.262
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: hindi na po bababa kasi ang pasahir, ang pasyente.

asr-000424
00:45:42.262 --> 00:45:49.680
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Kung maalala nyo po, isinasakay pa po mula sa ambulansya, inililipat yan sa ambulance.

asr-000425
00:45:49.680 --> 00:45:53.302
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, kung maalan po yan, magkakaproblema pa pa pag binubuhat yan.

asr-000426
00:45:53.302 --> 00:45:59.068
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, ang aming intention is to have this door-to-door na po,

asr-000427
00:45:59.068 --> 00:46:08.038
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: yung ambulansya na po mismo, ang isasakay ito at dadali na po sa paglilipat ng hospital na mas equipped kung hindi po kaya.

asr-000428
00:46:08.038 --> 00:46:17.839
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: At meron po kami, ito naman po ay the LGUs will have to secure licenses from Marina once they receive this.

asr-000429
00:46:17.839 --> 00:46:24.240
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: At we are starting with around 10 muna.

asr-000430
00:46:24.240 --> 00:46:30.331
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And then, we will proceed from there for the next years naman po ang pagbigay namin.

asr-000431
00:46:30.331 --> 00:46:31.520
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Kasi hindi naman din po lahat.

asr-000432
00:46:31.520 --> 00:46:38.079
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And by the way, this will be for the provincial governments po dahil medyo iba po ang maintenance nito.

asr-000433
00:46:38.079 --> 00:46:48.960
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, we will be giving this to the provincial governments for them to schedule kung alin po yung mga bayan nila na mas nangangailangan ito.

asr-000434
00:46:48.960 --> 00:47:00.880
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And then, doon po sa aming procurement.

asr-000435
00:47:00.880 --> 00:47:08.560
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: [unclear] whoever wins the procurement will maintain it for the first three years.

asr-000436
00:47:08.560 --> 00:47:13.440
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Including the training of the personnel na gagapit po nito.

asr-000437
00:47:13.440 --> 00:47:15.920
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: That's good to hear po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000438
00:47:15.920 --> 00:47:22.309
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: On equity in patient-transferred vehicle naman po, distribution and AI X-ray deployment.

asr-000439
00:47:22.309 --> 00:47:28.640
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Nag-report po kasi ang PCSO ng 100% distribution ng patient-transferred vehicles.

asr-000440
00:47:28.640 --> 00:47:30.240
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: 1,675.

asr-000441
00:47:30.240 --> 00:47:36.901
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: units na nagkakahalaga po ng around 3.73 billion.

asr-000442
00:47:36.901 --> 00:47:41.878
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: At pamimigay ng 197 million worth of medical equipment.

asr-000443
00:47:41.878 --> 00:47:45.892
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Tulad niya po nung na-mention ko na AI capable portable X-rays.

asr-000444
00:47:45.892 --> 00:47:54.280
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Ano po ang criteria ng PCSO sa pagpili ng mga probinsya or hospital na nakatanggap po nito?

asr-000445
00:47:54.280 --> 00:47:59.920
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: At tinitiyak ba natin or matitiyak pa po ba ng ating PCSO na ang...

asr-000446
00:47:59.920 --> 00:48:05.538
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: mga geographically isolated and disadvantaged areas or GIDAs

asr-000447
00:48:05.538 --> 00:48:16.000
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: ang nauuna sa pamimigay kumpara sa mga urbanized LGUs na may kakayanan naman bumili ng kanilang ambulansya?

asr-000448
00:48:16.000 --> 00:48:23.026
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Number one po, we give dun po sa, siyempre po, siyan mas nangangailangan.

asr-000449
00:48:23.026 --> 00:48:26.186
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: At sila po ang nakakaalam nun.

asr-000450
00:48:26.186 --> 00:48:30.742
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Ang mga hospitals ng LGU ang mas nakakaalam.

asr-000451
00:48:30.742 --> 00:48:33.704
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Ano po ang pinaka-priority ng pangangailangan nila?

asr-000452
00:48:33.704 --> 00:48:42.631
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Depende po sa kanilang mga personnel na hired to conduct such services and through the equipment na kaya nila.

asr-000453
00:48:42.631 --> 00:48:48.000
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Sapagkat kailangan din po dyan ng radiologist, mga specialization.

asr-000454
00:48:48.000 --> 00:48:54.160
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And the criteria is dapat po, they have to show na una-una kailangan nila.

asr-000455
00:48:54.160 --> 00:48:58.960
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And they can actually administer the service na inibigay sa nila.

asr-000456
00:48:58.960 --> 00:49:01.280
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And then of course,

asr-000457
00:49:01.280 --> 00:49:08.478
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: it is a matter po of, kasi pipila din po dito sa first-come, first-served din po sa amin.

asr-000458
00:49:08.478 --> 00:49:11.200
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Kung sino po ang mga kapaghingi po ng gano'n.

asr-000459
00:49:11.200 --> 00:49:13.040
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, it's a combination of this.

asr-000460
00:49:13.040 --> 00:49:16.640
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: If you need them, depende on the priority na kailangan.

asr-000461
00:49:16.640 --> 00:49:24.559
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And then the ability nila to train their personnel to handle such equipment.

asr-000462
00:49:24.559 --> 00:49:30.960
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: And then yun na nga po is the order po ng pag-re-request nila.

asr-000463
00:49:30.960 --> 00:49:32.240
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000464
