Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: And with that, everything speaks for itself.

asr-000467
00:49:45.300 --> 00:49:47.119
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: Nandito naman po sa kanilang report.

asr-000468
00:49:47.119 --> 00:49:54.480
Rep. Jan "Atty. JP" Padiernos: I just wanted to make a manifestation of my full support for the proposed budget ng ating PCSO.

asr-000469
00:49:54.480 --> 00:49:59.440
