00:55:17.040 --> 00:55:19.440
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: It's a blend of first-come, first-served po.

asr-000545
00:55:19.440 --> 00:55:23.839
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: And yung willingness ng LGU.

asr-000546
00:55:23.839 --> 00:55:29.927
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: Yung kumbaga very dense yung mga population doon sa city.

