00:55:42.510 --> 00:55:44.720
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: That na nabigay sa amin.

asr-000551
00:55:44.720 --> 00:55:46.540
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: And 2022 pa ho.

asr-000552
00:55:46.540 --> 00:55:51.940
Rep. Alexandria "Queenie" Gonzales: So, kung meron po, siguro kung meron po kayong mga up-and-coming,

