PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: doon po pati po gamot doon kapag available po sa amin.

asr-000577
00:57:26.963 --> 00:57:29.415
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: So, libring konsulta, may kasama pa pong gamot.

asr-000578
00:57:29.415 --> 00:57:32.791
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: At kung kailangan nga po ng ambulansya, we'll still provide.

asr-000579
00:57:32.791 --> 00:57:38.079
PCSO General Manager Melquiades Robles: Neighbor po namin kayo, hindi nyo po ina-avail.

